OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of revenge murder plot
OL,4,Aagainst brother's killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been cleared of a violent
OL,7,Frevenge murder plot against his
OL,8,Fbrother's killer.
OL,10,FKashif Sadiq was among nine men accused
OL,11,Fof conspiring to murder Hasim Uddin
OL,12,Ffollowing the death of his brother,
OL,13,FOmar, in September 2020.
OL,15,FHowever, the 35-year-old, alongside
OL,16,FRobert Daniel, 36, were found not
OL,17,Fguilty following a trial at the High
OL,18,FCourt in Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
