OL,5,
OL,6,FFour other men pled guilty to lesser
OL,7,Fcharges over a series of firebomb
OL,8,Fattacks, assaults and spying mission
OL,9,Frelated to the incident. They will be
OL,10,Fsentenced at a later date.
